/E (In recognition of Limb Loss Awareness Month, our team combined innovation with meaningful community engagement. In Pembroke Pines, they partnered with FIU students to design a 3D printed below knee prosthetic module, encouraging new ideas in patient care. Vinay and Riley also attended an Amputee Support Group at the Valparaiso Library, where they connected with individuals, shared insights, and learned from their inspiring stories and experiences.)
